/backend/Dockerfile @cra-norm-engine/maintainers
/.github/workflows/ @cra-norm-engine/maintainers

# Documentation and process
/docs/ @cra-norm-engine/maintainers
/SECURITY.md @cra-norm-engine/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md @cra-norm-engine/maintainers
/RELEASING.md @cra-norm-engine/maintainers

# Install scripts — extra scrutiny
/install.sh @cra-norm-engine/maintainers
